/**CFile****************************************************************

  FileName    [mapperCreate.c]

  PackageName [MVSIS 1.3: Multi-valued logic synthesis system.]

  Synopsis    [Generic technology mapping engine.]

  Author      [MVSIS Group]
  
  Affiliation [UC Berkeley]

  Date        [Ver. 2.0. Started - June 1, 2004.]

